    "The first hardware-decoded interval after fresh-profile initialization accepted only 19.12 fps despite the 8-second warmup. Later same-process and persistent-profile restart intervals reached 59.72 and 59.87 fps. The initial stalls are not solved or causally attributed; restart already counted 67 dropped frames before its measured interval.",
