    "Bilibili shader-LOD probe / WebGL context-loss messages remain in logs. Six page markers completed and native input/rendering passed without an observed browser/tab crash; this short test does not establish long-term stability or all WebGL compatibility.",
    "A separate diagnostic sample suggested parked-job deadline scanning as another lead; no CPU-time share or causal bottleneck was established and no scheduling rewrite is included.",
